              "titleHtml": "Anthropic, Message your other Claude Code sessions",
              "read": "2026-11-22",
              "url": "https://code.claude.com/docs/en/cross-session-messaging"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "spec.acp",
          "slug": "acp",
          "value": "partial",
          "detailHtml": "Only through a separate adapter: Anthropic's docs index has no ACP page, and <code>agentclientprotocol/claude-agent-acp</code> drives the Claude Agent SDK &quot;from any ACP client&quot;",
