      "reviewed": "2026-11-22",
      "url": "https://github.com/knowledgeislands/ki-agent-backpack/blob/75dd86fbff11a33b551fbd9d37b9d0576b1f9598/skills/keystone/ki-agentic-ecosystems/knowledge/products/product.claude-desktop.md",
      "summaryHtml": "Claude Desktop brings &quot;Claude's capabilities directly to your computer&quot; (<a href=\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/10065433-install-claude-desktop\">S1</a>). Anthropic makes it: a desktop app with Chat, Cowork, which &quot;brings Claude Code's agentic capabilities to knowledge work beyond coding&quot; (<a href=\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/13345190-get-started-with-claude-cowork\">S3</a>), and a Code tab running Claude Code inside the app, so it is the <a href=\"/glossary/agent-host/\">agent host</a> and <a href=\"/glossary/client/\">client</a> of those sessions (<a href=\"https://code.claude.com/docs/en/desktop\">S2</a>). It runs on macOS 13 or later, Windows 10 or later and, in beta, Linux (<a href=\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/10065433-install-claude-desktop\">S1</a>). It is proprietary: Chat works on every plan, Claude Code and Cowork need a paid one (<a href=\"https://support.claude.com/en/articles/10065433-install-claude-desktop\">S1</a>). The latest release seen is v6.28899.6, of 20 November 2026, bundling Claude Code 2.1.330 (<a href=\"https://claude.com/docs/cowork/claude-desktop-changelog\">S7</a>).",
      "instanceOf": [
