          "detailHtml": "OpenAI models by default, GPT-6.2 Sol from CLI 0.171.0; custom providers, local models through <code>ollama</code> and <code>lmstudio</code> (<code>--oss</code>), Amazon Bedrock and Google Vertex",
          "sources": [
            {
              "id": "S6",
              "titleHtml": "OpenAI, ChatGPT and Codex changelog",
