          "html": "Version 1.5.1, the stable release, supersedes 1.5.0 with bug, security and documentation fixes: &quot;text sent to a Claude session can no longer approve its permission prompt&quot;, and multi-city deployments sharing a rig store &quot;stop disturbing each other&quot;.",
