          "detailHtml": "<code>SKILL.md</code> folders in <code>~/.agents/skills/</code>, <code>.agents/skills/</code> and plugins, with <code>.goose/skills/</code> and <code>.claude/skills/</code> for compatibility; &quot;compatible with Claude Desktop and other agents that support Agent Skills&quot;",
