          "slug": "skill",
          "value": "partial",
          "detailHtml": "Skills are &quot;persistent expertise&quot;, built-in ones for Word documents, presentations, spreadsheets and PDFs plus a Skill Creator, made in conversation, uploaded or written; the pages read do not say they are <code>SKILL.md</code> folders or name the specification",
