          "detailHtml": "Every conversation is saved under <code>~/.grok/sessions/</code>; <code>/resume</code>, <code>grok --resume</code>, <code>-c</code>, <code>--fork-session</code>, <code>/fork</code> and <code>/rewind</code>",
