          "slug": "subagent",
          "value": "yes",
          "detailHtml": "&quot;Independent child sessions with their own context&quot; that &quot;return a summary to the parent&quot;; built-in <code>general-purpose</code>, <code>explore</code> and <code>plan</code>, on by default, optionally in their own worktrees",
