          "detailHtml": "<code>AGENTS.md</code>, <code>AGENT.md</code>, <code>CLAUDE.md</code> and <code>CLAUDE.local.md</code>, from <code>~/.grok/</code> and the repo root down, plus <code>.grok/rules/*.md</code>, with <code>.claude/rules/</code> and <code>.cursor/rules/</code> read too",
