          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "spec.acp",
          "slug": "acp",
          "value": "yes",
          "detailHtml": "As agent: &quot;Hermes Agent can run as an ACP server, letting ACP-compatible hosts talk to Hermes over stdio&quot;, after installing the ACP extra",
          "sources": [
            {
              "id": "S17",
              "titleHtml": "Nous Research, Hermes Agent docs: ACP Host Integration",
