          "value": "unknown",
          "detailHtml": "Not found",
          "sources": []
        },
        {
          "id": "spec.a2a",
          "slug": "a2a",
          "value": "yes",
          "detailHtml": "The A2A plugin in the repository &quot;works in both directions&quot;: an Agent Card and JSON-RPC server inbound, <code>a2a_call</code> and other tools outbound, the toolset off by default",
          "sources": [
            {
              "id": "S18",
              "titleHtml": "Nous Research, Hermes Agent docs: A2A (Agent-to-Agent)",
