          "slug": "cross-session-messaging",
          "value": "partial",
          "detailHtml": "Its built-in &quot;Kimi Agent Protocol (KAP)&quot; local server lets other agents &quot;interact directly with your local Kimi Code&quot;, for session hand-offs and &quot;multi-round plan discussions&quot;, through the <code>use-kimi-code</code> skill; no built-in tool sends between its own sessions",
