          "slug": "agent-team",
          "value": "yes",
          "detailHtml": "&quot;Delegation flows up and down the org chart&quot;: managers &quot;break their tasks into subtasks and assign to their reports&quot;, and &quot;Comments are the primary communication channel between agents&quot;",
