            },
            {
              "id": "S13",
              "titleHtml": "Paperclip Labs, Paperclip docs: Heartbeats and routines",
              "read": "2026-11-22",
              "url": "https://docs.paperclip.ing/guides/projects-workflow/routines/"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "industry.cross-session-messaging",
          "slug": "cross-session-messaging",
          "value": "yes",
          "detailHtml": "Agents message each other through task comments, and &quot;a comment on an open task&quot; wakes the assignee; &quot;@mentions ... don't wake the mentioned agent&quot;; Agent Chat is between a person and an agent",
          "sources": [
            {
              "id": "S13",
              "titleHtml": "Paperclip Labs, Paperclip docs: Heartbeats and routines",
              "read": "2026-11-22",
              "url": "https://docs.paperclip.ing/guides/projects-workflow/routines/"
            },
            {
              "id": "S17",
              "titleHtml": "Paperclip Labs, Paperclip docs: Issues API",
              "read": "2026-11-22",
              "url": "https://docs.paperclip.ing/reference/api/issues/"
            },
            {
              "id": "S12",
              "titleHtml": "Paperclip Labs, Paperclip docs: Agent Chat",
              "read": "2026-11-22",
              "url": "https://docs.paperclip.ing/experimental/agent-chat/"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "spec.acp",
          "slug": "acp",
          "value": "yes",
          "detailHtml": "As client: <code>claude_local</code>, <code>codex_local</code>, <code>gemini_local</code> and <code>kimi_local</code> run &quot;through the Agent Client Protocol&quot; under the default <code>engine: auto</code>; &quot;ACP agents include qualified Cursor, Pi, and GitHub Copilot runtimes&quot;",
          "sources": [
            {
              "id": "S5",
              "titleHtml": "Paperclip Labs, Paperclip docs: Adapters overview",
              "read": "2026-11-22",
              "url": "https://docs.paperclip.ing/reference/adapters/overview/"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "spec.ahp",
          "slug": "ahp",
          "value": "unknown",
          "detailHtml": "Not found",
          "sources": []
        },
        {
          "id": "spec.a2a",
          "slug": "a2a",
          "value": "unknown",
          "detailHtml": "Not found; external agents join over MCP and HTTPS webhooks",
          "sources": [
            {
              "id": "S14",
              "titleHtml": "Paperclip Labs, Paperclip docs: External agents",
              "read": "2026-11-22",
              "url": "https://docs.paperclip.ing/experimental/external-agents/"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "id": "system.bot",
          "slug": "bot",
          "value": "yes",
          "detailHtml": "Each agent is named, with a role, a manager, &quot;a persistent Ed25519 keypair&quot; and its own folder for &quot;notes, memory, reference material&quot;; it wakes on timers, assignments, comments and routines",
          "sources": [
            {
              "id": "S15",
              "titleHtml": "Paperclip Labs, Paperclip docs: Agents",
              "read": "2026-11-22",
              "url": "https://docs.paperclip.ing/guides/org/agents/"
            },
            {
              "id": "S13",
              "titleHtml": "Paperclip Labs, Paperclip docs: Heartbeats and routines",
              "read": "2026-11-22",
              "url": "https://docs.paperclip.ing/guides/projects-workflow/routines/"
            }
          ]
        }
      ],
