          "html": "Version 2026.1117.0, marked breaking: &quot;The Coordinator workspace and Agent Chat are standard&quot;, agents post to their responsible person's chat with <code>send_chat_message</code>, sandbox workspaces survive a server replacement, and a boxd provider plugin runs each sandbox as a KVM microVM.",
          "sources": [
