        {
          "id": "industry.environment",
          "slug": "environment",
          "value": "yes",
          "detailHtml": "<code>harness-sandbox</code> or <code>container</code>, opt-in: macOS Seatbelt, Linux bwrap or Landlock for tools, Docker or Podman; &quot;Sandboxing reduces but doesn't eliminate all risks&quot;",
