          "slug": "agent-host",
          "value": "partial",
          "detailHtml": "Built-in <code>claude-code</code> and <code>codex</code> agents &quot;delegate to separately installed native tools&quot;, Claude Code through its <code>claude-agent-acp</code> adapter; &quot;Native sessions cannot be restored after restarting Qwen Code&quot;",
